{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"他努力整理好自己，不让别人看见动摇。\",\n      \"source\": \"这种挺拔的姿态，可以听成一种强烈的自我控制。像一个人整理好衣服、抬起头，不让别人看见动摇。\",\n      \"type\": \"6\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿把整理衣服、抬头作为音乐姿态的比喻，屏幕稿则将其转成他实际在努力整理自己、掩饰动摇的心理行为。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"screen\": \"害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了。\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这股推进听成人的处境，最动人的不是忽然变得无所畏惧，而是害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了。\",\n      \"type\": \"6\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将脚步向前作为音乐推进的比喻性听法，屏幕稿放进人物叙述后变成了他已经向前迈步的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"仍然决定怎样站立\",\n      \"source\": \"仍然可以决定怎样站立。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把仍有能力作出选择改成已经作出选择，确定程度有所加强。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2c28cf5-8fe2-466f-9014-c0d3d32f9f00", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T065334710012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 359.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:59:34.562654+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ed1fe8ec169ce1526162660c04b2b1e6b7c3257d7e15646d0053c2dfdbefaecc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "aut